{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13376","headline":"让皇帝庙乐章 奠币 · 李纾","name":"让皇帝庙乐章 奠币","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惟帝时若，去而上仙。\n祀用商武，乐备宫悬。\n白壁加荐，玄纁告虔。\n子孙拜後，承兹吉蠲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李纾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}